{"seq":1,"slug":"tests-generic-singular","title":"generic/singular 测试与单元测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/analytics-engineering-dbt/testing-docs/tests-generic-singular","wordCount":2779,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"generic-singular-测试与单元测试\">generic/singular 测试与单元测试</h1><p>dbt 测试的本质是<strong>把&quot;我认为这份数据应该长什么样&quot;变成可执行的断言</strong>。这个定义里最关键的是&quot;可执行&quot;——写在文档里的质量期望会随时间腐化，写在测试里的期望会在下次 <code>dbt test</code> 时重新生效。dbt 提供三种测试机制：generic 测试（YAML 声明、可复用）、singular 测试（独立 SQL 文件）、以及 dbt 单元测试（v1.8+，对固定输入断言输出）。三者的能力和适用场景差别很大，混用会让项目既臃肿又漏检。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>三类测试在&quot;测什么&quot;和&quot;在哪测&quot;上的定位：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 数据层&#10;    R[原始数据 / 真实上游] --&gt; M[模型输出表]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 测试类型&#10;    G[&quot;generic 测试&lt;br/&gt;YAML 声明 + 参数&lt;br/&gt;可复用, 测真实数据&quot;]&#10;    S[&quot;singular 测试&lt;br/&gt;独立 SQL 文件&lt;br/&gt;一次性, 测真实数据&quot;]&#10;    U[&quot;unit 测试&lt;br/&gt;YAML 给定输入行&lt;br/&gt;不依赖真实数据, 测转换逻辑&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    M --&gt; G&#10;    M --&gt; S&#10;    U -.-&gt;|断言 SQL 逻辑| M\">graph TD\n    subgraph 数据层\n    R[原始数据 / 真实上游] --&gt; M[模型输出表]\n    end\n    subgraph 测试类型\n    G[\"generic 测试&lt;br/&gt;YAML 声明 + 参数&lt;br/&gt;可复用, 测真实数据\"]\n    S[\"singular 测试&lt;br/&gt;独立 SQL 文件&lt;br/&gt;一次性, 测真实数据\"]\n    U[\"unit 测试&lt;br/&gt;YAML 给定输入行&lt;br/&gt;不依赖真实数据, 测转换逻辑\"]\n    end\n    M --&gt; G\n    M --&gt; S\n    U -.-&gt;|断言 SQL 逻辑| M</pre><p>三种测试的对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>generic</th>\n<th>singular</th>\n<th>unit test</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>定义位置</td>\n<td><code>models/**/*.yml</code> 的 <code>tests:</code></td>\n<td><code>tests/*.sql</code></td>\n<td><code>models/**/*.yml</code> 的 <code>unit_tests:</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复用性</td>\n<td>高（跨模型、可传参、可被包提供）</td>\n<td>无（一次性）</td>\n<td>中（按模型定义）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输入</td>\n<td>真实模型输出</td>\n<td>真实模型输出</td>\n<td>YAML 里写死的行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行时机</td>\n<td><code>dbt test</code>（数据已物化后）</td>\n<td>同左</td>\n<td><code>dbt test --select test_type:unit</code>（先建临时表跑，不依赖上游）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败信号</td>\n<td>返回非空行 = 失败</td>\n<td>同左</td>\n<td>输出与期望不符</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合测什么</td>\n<td>唯一性、非空、关系完整性、接受值、范围</td>\n<td>复杂业务规则、跨表一致性、时效性</td>\n<td>转换逻辑本身（case when、窗口函数、关联）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行成本</td>\n<td>每条测试一次全表扫描</td>\n<td>同左，可能更重</td>\n<td>先在内存/临时表上跑，很轻</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数量级建议</td>\n<td>数百条</td>\n<td>十几条</td>\n<td>与关键模型数量同阶</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一个能解释大部分实践的经验：<strong>generic 测试应该覆盖&quot;数据形态&quot;这类通用不变量，singular 测试应该覆盖&quot;业务规则&quot;这类一次性断言，unit 测试应该覆盖&quot;逻辑分支&quot;这类不依赖数据的推理。</strong> 三者不重叠，也不互为替代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"generic-测试-内置四种与参数化\">generic 测试：内置四种与参数化</h2><p>dbt 内置四个 generic 测试，都通过 YAML 声明：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"models:&#10;  - name: fct_orders&#10;    columns:&#10;      - name: order_id&#10;        tests:&#10;          - unique&#10;          - not_null&#10;      - name: order_status&#10;        tests:&#10;          - accepted_values:&#10;              values: [&#39;pending&#39;, &#39;paid&#39;, &#39;shipped&#39;, &#39;cancelled&#39;, &#39;refunded&#39;]&#10;      - name: customer_id&#10;        tests:&#10;          - relationships:&#10;              to: ref(&#39;dim_customers&#39;)&#10;              field: customer_id\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">models</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">fct_orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    columns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        tests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">unique</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">not_null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order_status</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        tests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">accepted_values</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              values</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pending'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'paid'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'shipped'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cancelled'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'refunded'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">customer_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        tests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">relationships</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              to</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ref('dim_customers')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              field</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">customer_id</span></span></code></pre></div><p>各自的能力和常见误区：</p>\n<p><strong><code>unique</code> / <code>not_null</code></strong> 是最基础的两个，覆盖粒度键与必填列。它们的执行代价是每列一次全表扫描（<code>unique</code> 实际是 <code>group by ... having count(*) &gt; 1</code>），在宽表上给十几列都挂 <code>not_null</code> 会让 <code>dbt test</code> 显著变慢。合理的做法是只给粒度键、主外键、以及下游会用于过滤的列挂测试。</p>\n<p><strong><code>accepted_values</code></strong> 检查列值落在给定集合内。两个陷阱：一是枚举值会随业务变化（新增一个 <code>partially_refunded</code> 状态），测试需要跟着改，因此它适合&quot;业务上确实封闭且稳定的枚举&quot;，不适合&quot;当前出现过的所有值&quot;；二是 <code>NULL</code> 的处理——默认 <code>NULL</code> 会被视为不在集合内从而失败，如果该列允许为空，需要显式在 <code>values</code> 里加上 <code>null</code>，或者改用 <code>not_null</code> 与 <code>accepted_values</code> 分开决策。</p>\n<p><strong><code>relationships</code></strong> 检查外键完整性（子表的每个非空值都能在父表找到）。它是最有价值也最容易被滥用的测试：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>它在父表上跑 <code>left join</code>，<strong>父表越大越慢</strong>；在大维度表上挂 <code>relationships</code> 是常见的性能黑洞。</li>\n<li>默认 <code>NULL</code> 外键会被跳过（这通常是想要的），但如果业务要求外键非空，必须另挂 <code>not_null</code>。</li>\n<li>在增量的父子表上，&quot;子表已更新但父表还没跑完&quot;会造成瞬时失败，因此关系测试在 CI 中可能需要在 staged 环境下跑（见 <a href=\"../performance-delivery/cicd-environments\">CI/CD、环境提升与 promotion 流程</a>）。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><code>accepted_range</code> / <code>not_accepted_values</code></strong> 属于 <code>dbt-expectations</code> 包，不属于内置。内置只有上面四种。这一点经常被记错，包生态的取舍见 <a href=\"packages-macros\">包生态、宏复用与 Jinja 治理</a>。</p>\n<p>generic 测试还支持两个对所有测试生效的配置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"models:&#10;  - name: fct_orders&#10;    config:&#10;      tags: [&#39;finance&#39;, &#39;daily&#39;]&#10;    columns:&#10;      - name: order_id&#10;        tests:&#10;          - unique:&#10;              config:&#10;                severity: error&#10;                where: &#39;ordered_at &gt;= current_date - 7&#39;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">models</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">fct_orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      tags</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'finance'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'daily'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    columns</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">order_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        tests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">unique</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">              config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">error</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">                where</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'ordered_at >= current_date - 7'</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>severity</code> 可以是 <code>error</code>（失败即 <code>dbt test</code> 退出非零）或 <code>warn</code>（警告但仍成功）。<code>where</code> 可以缩小测试扫描范围——对超大的事实表，<code>where: &quot;ordered_at &gt;= current_date - 30&quot;</code> 能把测试成本降低一个数量级，代价是更早的数据不再被保护。选择 <code>warn</code> 时要警惕：一个长期 <code>warn</code> 的测试等于没有测试，没人会看日志里的黄字。</p>\n<h2 id=\"singular-测试-写业务规则\">singular 测试：写业务规则</h2><p>singular 测试就是 <code>tests/</code> 目录下的一个 SQL 文件，约定是&quot;查询返回的行 = 失败的行&quot;。它不需要任何 YAML，直接用 <code>ref()</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- tests/assert_order_total_matches_line_items.sql&#10;-- 每笔订单的金额应等于其订单行金额之和（容差 0.01）&#10;with order_totals as (&#10;    select order_id, amount&#10;    from {{ ref(&#39;fct_orders&#39;) }}&#10;),&#10;line_totals as (&#10;    select order_id, sum(line_amount) as expected_amount&#10;    from {{ ref(&#39;fct_order_items&#39;) }}&#10;    group by 1&#10;)&#10;select&#10;    o.order_id,&#10;    o.amount,&#10;    l.expected_amount,&#10;    abs(o.amount - l.expected_amount) as diff&#10;from order_totals o&#10;inner join line_totals l using (order_id)&#10;where abs(o.amount - l.expected_amount) &gt; 0.01\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- tests/assert_order_total_matches_line_items.sql</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 每笔订单的金额应等于其订单行金额之和（容差 0.01）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_totals </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id, amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {{ ref(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'fct_orders'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">line_totals </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    select</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_id, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">sum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(line_amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expected_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {{ ref(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'fct_order_items'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) }}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    group by</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">select</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">expected_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">expected_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> diff</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_totals o</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">inner join</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> line_totals l </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">using</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (order_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">where</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> abs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">o</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> l</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">expected_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">01</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个例子体现了 singular 测试最适合的三类场景：</p>\n<p><strong>跨表一致性</strong>：事实表之间的对账（订单金额 vs 订单行求和、库存变动 vs 出入库记录）。这类规则无法用 generic 测试表达，因为 generic 只作用于单列。</p>\n<p><strong>复杂的时效与完整性规则</strong>：例如&quot;每天的 <code>fct_orders</code> 行数不应比前一天少超过 20%&quot;，或&quot;每个客户在 <code>dim_customers</code> 里的 <code>valid_from</code> 早于其首笔订单时间&quot;。这些是需要 join 多个视图才能判断的断言。</p>\n<p><strong>数据量的合理性边界</strong>：<code>select * from {{ ref(&#39;fct_orders&#39;) }} having count(*) = 0</code>（当天零行通常意味着上游断了），或者&quot;分区覆盖完整性&quot;——检查某个日期范围内是否存在缺失的日期分区。</p>\n<p>写 singular 测试的三个实践要点：</p>\n<p><strong>第一，返回列包含足够诊断信息。</strong> 上面例子返回了 <code>order_id</code>、两个金额和差值。如果只返回 <code>select 1</code>，失败时你只知道&quot;有 5000 行失败&quot;，不知道是哪些。失败的测试应当自解释。</p>\n<p><strong>第二，控制返回行数上限。</strong> 在测试里加 <code>limit 100</code>。一个返回百万行的测试输出会让 CI 日志不可读，而且没有必要——前 100 行足以定位问题。</p>\n<p><strong>第三，命名要说明断言内容。</strong> 约定是 <code>assert_&lt;what&gt;_&lt;condition&gt;</code> 或 <code>&lt;subject&gt;_&lt;expectation&gt;</code>，例如 <code>assert_order_total_matches_line_items</code>。名字是失败时唯一会被看到的上下文。</p>\n<p>singular 测试在 <code>dbt build</code> 中会像其他测试一样被安排在依赖它们的模型之后执行，因此它天然能访问已物化的表。</p>\n<h2 id=\"dbt-单元测试-不依赖真实数据验证逻辑\">dbt 单元测试：不依赖真实数据验证逻辑</h2><p>前两类测试有一个共同前提：<strong>被测模型已经跑过一次，且上游数据是真实的</strong>。这在 CI 里很尴尬：要验证一个 <code>case when</code> 分支，你得先把整条上游链路跑通，或者用错误百出的样本数据。dbt v1.8 引入的单元测试解决了这个问题——用 YAML 里写死的输入行，断言模型的输出行。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"unit_tests:&#10;  - name: test_refund_logic&#10;    model: fct_orders&#10;    given:&#10;      - input: ref(&#39;stg_shopify__orders&#39;)&#10;        rows:&#10;          - { order_id: &#39;1&#39;, amount: 100.00, refunded_amount: 0.00 }&#10;          - { order_id: &#39;2&#39;, amount: 100.00, refunded_amount: 100.00 }&#10;          - { order_id: &#39;3&#39;, amount: 100.00, refunded_amount: 30.00 }&#10;      - input: ref(&#39;stg_stripe__payments&#39;)&#10;        rows:&#10;          - { order_id: &#39;1&#39;, paid_amount: 100.00 }&#10;          - { order_id: &#39;2&#39;, paid_amount: 100.00 }&#10;          - { order_id: &#39;3&#39;, paid_amount: 70.00 }&#10;    expect:&#10;      rows:&#10;        - { order_id: &#39;1&#39;, amount: 100.00, net_amount: 100.00, status: &#39;paid&#39; }&#10;        - { order_id: &#39;2&#39;, amount: 100.00, net_amount: 0.00, status: &#39;refunded&#39; }&#10;        - { order_id: &#39;3&#39;, amount: 100.00, net_amount: 70.00, status: &#39;partial&#39; }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">unit_tests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">test_refund_logic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    model</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">fct_orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    given</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">input</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ref('stg_shopify__orders')</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        rows</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100.00</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">refunded_amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.00</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">          - { </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">order_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8